## Diagram generation rules

@Diagram produces exactly ONE `.mmd` file per invocation.

If multiple diagrams are needed → multiple calls. Make these calls sequentially in the same user turn to generate all missing or outdated diagram types (sequence, class, state, erd, deployment) rather than stopping after one.

If required upstream artifacts are missing or contain only placeholders, do not halt the turn: first run the corresponding upstream agent (@Architecture, @API or @Requirements) to generate/repair them, then proceed to run @Diagram for the model.

Parameters required:
- diagram_type
- input_path
- output_path
- skill_path
- diagram_name

