## Validation rule

Every OpenAPI document, CI pipeline file and Mermaid model MUST pass its validator with zero errors before you report it as produced.
Retry up to 3 times, then report the unresolved validator errors verbatim. Never call a file "validated" when the validator degraded to a structural-only check — say so instead.

